Converted by AssetANT's scripts/cubemap/equirect_to_cubemap.py with assets/kloofendal_43d_clear_puresky/cubemap.json:
six 512x512 sRGB PNG faces in Vulkan's cubemap order (RT +X, LF -X, UP +Y, DN -Y, FT +Z, BK -Z),
4x4 supersampled, radiance times 0.5 and clipped to 1 before sRGB encoding, turned -86 degrees about +Y
so the HDRI's sun faces BeschleunigerBallett's default sun direction.
